---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Security | Bloc Microfinance Bank" description="How Bloc protects your money and data, safe banking habits, and how to report fraud." path="/security/" section="company" breadcrumb={[{"name": "Security", "path": "/security/"}]}>
<section class="iph"><div class="w"><div class="ihl">
<nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Security</span></nav>
<h1>How Bloc protects your money and data.</h1>
<p class="lead">Simple protections that work in the background, and a few habits that help you stay safe.</p>
<div class="acts"><a class="btn p" href="/personal/#download">Download app</a><a class="btn o" href="/business/#open">Open a business account</a></div>
</div></div></section><section class="sec cream sec2" id="security"><div class="w"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Security</span></div>
<h2>Security and protection.</h2>
<p class="lead">Simple protections that work in the background, so you can bank without worry.</p>
<div class="sgrid">
<div class="si2"><div class="ib ch"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div><div><b>One trusted phone</b><span>Only one phone is active at a time.</span></div></div>
<div class="si2"><div class="ib ch"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div><div><b>Passcode and fingerprint</b><span>Sign in with your passcode or a touch.</span></div></div>
<div class="si2"><div class="ib ch"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></div><div><b>A pause on new phones</b><span>A short wait when you sign in on a new phone.</span></div></div>
<div class="si2"><div class="ib ch"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M22 7l-10 7L2 7"/></svg></div><div><b>Alerts on every sign-in</b><span>We email you whenever someone signs in.</span></div></div>
<div class="si2"><div class="ib ch"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 3-6.7L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg></div><div><b>Money back, with a time</b><span>If a transfer fails, we tell you when it is back.</span></div></div>
<div class="si2"><div class="ib ch"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M4.9 4.9l14.2 14.2"/></svg></div><div><b>We never ask for your passcode</b><span>Bloc will never ask for your passcode or a code.</span></div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="duo"><i class="bg ch"></i><div class="ph" style="--pw:230px;"><img src="/assets/app-Security.webp" alt="Bloc app security screen showing this phone is trusted" width="390" height="844" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ph" style="--pw:230px;"><img src="/assets/app-DeviceHold.webp" alt="Bloc app screen showing a pause when signing in on a new phone" width="390" height="844" loading="lazy"></div></div>
</div></section><section class="sec sky" id="tips"><div class="w">
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Stay safe</span></div>
<h2>Four habits that keep your money safe.</h2>
<div class="grid4b">
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></div><h3>Keep your passcode private</h3><p>Bloc will never ask for your passcode or a code we send you.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg></div><h3>Check before you confirm</h3><p>Read the name and amount on the confirmation screen.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div><h3>Use the official app</h3><p>Download Bloc only from the App Store or Google Play.</p></div>
<div class="ipc"><div class="ipi"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M22 7l-10 7L2 7"/></svg></div><h3>Report anything odd</h3><p>Tell us at once if something does not look right.</p></div>
</div></div></section><section class="stmt" aria-label="Regulation"><div class="w"><div><div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Regulation</span></div><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Licensed by the CBN.<br>Insured by the NDIC.</h2>
<p>Bloc Microfinance Bank operates under a licence from the Central Bank of Nigeria. Deposits are insured by the Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation, subject to its limits.</p></div>
<div class="sl"><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="141" height="150" src="/assets/reg-cbn.png" alt="CBN logo"></div><div><b>Licensed by the CBN</b><span>Central Bank of Nigeria</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="420" height="178" src="/assets/reg-ndic.png" alt="NDIC logo"></div><div><b>Insured by NDIC</b><span>Nigeria Deposit Insurance Corporation</span></div></div><div class="ti"><div class="tl"><img width="160" height="160" src="/assets/reg-ndpc.png" alt="NDPC logo"></div><div><b>NDPA compliant</b><span>Nigeria Data Protection Act</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec" id="report"><div class="w split2"><div>
<div class="lab "><i class="ch"></i><span>Report fraud</span></div>
<h2>Think someone has your details?</h2>
<p class="lead">Tell us straight away.</p></div>
<div class="ipl"><div class="ipn"><b>In the app</b><span>Chat with us from the Help screen at any time.</span></div><div class="ipn"><b>By email</b><span><a class="ul2" href="mailto:frauddesk@blocmfb.com">frauddesk@blocmfb.com</a></span></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
